'' A stray word between a procedure's name and its parameters is fbc's error 3 -- 8 errors
'' on fbc-modern 1.20 and 1.10.1 alike, on exactly these lines (2026-09-19): 'thiscall',
'' 'fastcall' and any other word, declared or defined, in a type, after OVERLOAD, after
'' ALIAS, with no list. From line 20 on is accepted by both: '__thiscall', '__fastcall',
'' NAKED, and OVERRIDE with no parameter list.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/proc-stray-word.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 8
'' EXPECT-OUT: proc-stray-word.bas(7,17): error TKO0420: expected the end of the statement
'' EXPECT-OUT: proc-stray-word.bas(8,17): error TKO0420: expected the end of the statement
'' EXPECT-OUT: proc-stray-word.bas(9,17): error TKO0420: expected the end of the statement
'' EXPECT-OUT: proc-stray-word.bas(10,9): error TKO0420: expected the end of the statement
'' EXPECT-OUT: proc-stray-word.bas(12,17): error TKO0420: expected the end of the statement
'' EXPECT-OUT: proc-stray-word.bas(13,30): error TKO0420: expected the end of the statement
'' EXPECT-OUT: proc-stray-word.bas(14,17): error TKO0420: expected the end of the statement
'' EXPECT-OUT: proc-stray-word.bas(17,19): error TKO0420: expected the end of the statement
